   "y": 1005.0,
   "w": 246.0,
   "h": 15.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 15.22,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Assessment"
  },
  {
   "id": "59:856",
   "x": 741.98,
   "y": 1235.0,
   "w": 246.0,
   "h": 15.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 15.22,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Planning"
  },
  {
   "id": "59:857",
   "x": 741.98,
   "y": 1411.0,
   "w": 246.0,
   "h": 15.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 15.22,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Ongoing care"
  },
  {
   "id": "59:858",
   "x": 742.0,
   "y": 855.0,
   "w": 275.0,
   "h": 106.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Every relationship with the clinic begins with a conversation, not a procedure. We ask what concerns you, what you have already tried, and what kind of result would feel meaningful rather than excessive."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:859",
   "x": 742.0,
   "y": 1028.0,
   "w": 281.0,
   "h": 153.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "We consider the face in three parts. Structure is what supports it: volume, contour and the muscles beneath. Surface is the skin itself: tone, texture and hydration. Cohesion is not a category of concern but the discipline that connects the two, the judgement that decides which to address, in which order, and why."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:860",
   "x": 742.0,
   "y": 1258.24,
   "w": 275.0,
   "h": 153.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Findings from the assessment become a plan specific to your face and to your own goals, sequenced across whatever timeframe best suits you. Nothing is ever proposed without the reasoning behind it."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:861",
   "x": 742.0,
   "y": 1434.24,
   "w": 275.0,
   "h": 153.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Skin and structure both change over time, so care continues rather than concludes. Review appointments track what is working and keep your full treatment history known to whoever next cares for you."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:862",
   "x": 589.47,
   "y": 404.0,
   "w": 548.0,
   "h": 88.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Our focus is deliberately narrow: the lower face, and how it ages. We are obsessive about finding the most effective non-surgical protocols and devices for lower-face tightening, skin rejuvenation and collagen stimulation, because that is where our expertise lies: skin and structure, and what is genuinely achievable without surgery."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:863",
   "x": 589.0,
   "y": 1885.0,
   "w": 500.0,
   "h": 88.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Kensington considers the face in three parts. Structure is what supports it: volume, contour and the muscles beneath. Surface is the skin itself: tone, texture and hydration. Cohesion is not a category of concern but the discipline that connects the two the judgement that decides which to address, in which order, and why."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:864",
   "x": 1301.47,
   "y": 404.0,
   "w": 246.0,
   "h": 15.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 15.22,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Lower-face tightening"
  },
  {
   "id": "59:865",
   "x": 1301.47,
   "y": 525.32,
   "w": 246.0,
   "h": 15.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 15.22,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Skin rejuvenation"
  },
  {
   "id": "59:866",
   "x": 1301.47,
   "y": 640.32,
   "w": 246.0,
   "h": 15.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 15.22,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Collagen stimulation"
  },
  {
   "id": "59:867",
   "x": 1302.47,
   "y": 434.32,
   "w": 295.0,
   "h": 53.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "The concern we are most focused on. We adopt whichever protocol gives the closest result to surgery, without it."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:868",
   "x": 1302.47,
   "y": 551.32,
   "w": 288.0,
   "h": 53.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Tone, texture and quality of the surface, treated with the same rigour as structure, never as an afterthought."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:869",
   "x": 1302.0,
   "y": 671.0,
   "w": 322.0,
   "h": 53.0,
   "size": 16,
   "lineHeight": 17.42,
   "align": "left",
   "text": "Long-term skin quality depends on collagen, not a single session. Our protocols are built to stimulate and sustain it."
  },
  {
   "id": "59:870",
   "x": 1318.0,
   "y": 1964.0,
